#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD0005 expect=skipped domain=DU
#note "Regression pin for the T1 Scope fix (ERROR lane): DO/DT/DU/DX are excluded per the FDA sheet, so this conformant SDTMIG-MD DU dataset is out of the rule's scope."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DU class=FINDINGS label="Device-In-Use"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SPDEVID type=Char label="Sponsor Device Identifier"
col DUSEQ   type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DUTESTCD type=Char label="Device-In-Use Test Short Name"
---
S1 | DU | 001 | DEV1 | 1 | SETTING
S1 | DU | 001 | DEV2 | 1 | SETTING
